  "extract": "The Chichu Art Museum  is a museum built directly into a southern portion of the island of Naoshima in Kagawa Prefecture, Japan. It was designed by architect Tadao Ando and opened to the public on July 18, 2004.",
  "extract_html": "<p>The <b>Chichu Art Museum</b><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"> </span> is a museum built directly into a southern portion of the island of Naoshima in Kagawa Prefecture, Japan. It was designed by architect Tadao Ando and opened to the public on July 18, 2004.</p>"
